ContentUnavailableView), error (retry affordance), data (8 tiles), stale + offline
(connectivity banner + refresh; cached tiles stay visible). i18n: every literal via the
P1/S10 facade (NSLocalizedString table "QuickStatsGrid"). a11y: per-tile combined VoiceOver
labels, decorative icons hidden, refresh button labelled, Dynamic Type via tokens,
reduce-motion respected via shared TSFadeIn.

Parity notes vs web source: rated_range/odometer read as SI metres, speed as m/s, temps as
°C, converted at the display boundary (precision 0 for distance/speed, default 1 for temp);
power rendered as `${fmtNumber(power)} kW` verbatim (web does NOT route power through the
unit facade); battery accent green when >50 else cyan; speed subtitle Driving/Parked.

